# Opus Quad fixture: constructed-opus-status-zero-flags
# Constructed from the documented layout, not a capture. It reproduces the
# malformed packets beat-link guards against: an Opus Quad status whose
# status-flag byte F (0x89) is zero
#   (https://github.com/Deep-Symmetry/beat-link/blob/main/src/main/java/org/deepsymmetry/beatlink/VirtualRekordbox.java, `buildUpdate`).
# Layout: https://djl-analysis.deepsymmetry.org/djl-analysis/vcdj.html#cdj-status-packet
# Documented in: docs/protocols/opus-quad.md#quirks
# Deck 2 (device 0x0a), F = 0x00, P2 = 0xfa (moving), track 128.00 BPM at
# +0 %, beat 258, bar beat 2, Mm = 0, track ID 1234. Length 0xd4 as above.
# Bytes: UDP payload, hex, 16 per line.
51 73 70 74 31 57 6d 4a 4f 4c 0a 4f 50 55 53 2d
51 55 41 44 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 01
03 0a 00 b0 0a 00 01 01 0a 03 01 00 00 00 04 d2
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 ff fa 00 10 00 00
80 00 32 00 7f ff ff ff 00 10 00 00 00 0d 00 ff
00 00 01 02 01 ff 02 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
00 10 00 00 00 10 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00
